From: Ian Blenke <ian@blenke.com>
Date: Sun, 21 Jun 2026 21:50:15 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 03349/11362] [outer-loop] arc: E3 (SUBMITTED policy) +
 diversity validation -- 3/3 recovery games, induction does not interfere

Re-ran on the 3090 (CUDA, after killing the stale iGPU server being reused): the SUBMITTED E3AgentPolicy
with CARNOT_ARC_EXPLORE_DIVERSITY=1 recovers all 3 structure-missed games (r11l@479, sp80@401, cd82@882)
-- IDENTICAL to the explorer-policy validation (same actions+efficiencies). The LLM induction cascade
(same stall trigger) does NOT block the diversity injection: the no-op induction falls back to diversity-
augmented exploration and the games recover. Definitive pre-shot confirmation the hybrid works through the
full submitted path. Submission is confidently gate-justified.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
